# --- ~/.config/swirl/config.d/user ----------------------------------------
# Your Swirl overrides. Loaded LAST, so anything here wins over SweetPotato
# defaults. Updates (sweetpotatos-update / materialize / install.sh re-runs)
# never overwrite this file once it exists.
#
# Edit this file, then reload: Mod+Shift+c
#
# --- who owns what --------------------------------------------------------
#   SweetPotato defaults   ~/.config/swirl/config (+ scripts)   replaced by updates
#   you                    this file                            yours forever
#   whole-file fork        ~/.config/sweetpotatos/user_edits/…  also survives updates
#
# --- examples -------------------------------------------------------------
# Extra bind (does not remove the default unless you unbind first):
#    bindsym $mod+Shift+b exec firefox
#
# Replace a default bind:
#    unbindsym $mod+w
#    bindsym $mod+w exec firefox
#
# Floating rule:
#    for_window [app_id="mpv"] floating enable
#
# --- end of header; add your lines below ----------------------------------
